# Workspace Rules: League Classic

- ALL advice, guides, builds, items, masteries, runes, and champion mechanics provided in this workspace MUST strictly adhere to Classic League of Legends (Season 1 - Season 3 era).
- DO NOT suggest modern League of Legends runes (e.g., Fleet Footwork, Electrocute, First Strike, Runes Reforged), modern items (e.g., Malignance, Cryptbloom, Mythics), or modern game concepts.
- Always use the classic Rune Page system (Marks, Seals, Glyphs, Quintessences) and the classic 21/9/0 or 9/0/21 Mastery trees.
- Always reference classic item paths (e.g., Rod of Ages, Deathfire Grasp, Archangel's Staff, Abyssal Scepter, Zhonya's Hourglass, Force of Nature, Mejai's).
